      <data key="v_text">Saturday 19th in #Achill. 
Music, words and an art corner to make a &apos;postcard for #Palestine&apos;. These will be given to TDs. 
It&apos;s near #Keel beach at the Bervie garden, or if rainy, in Keel Hall. 
Funds going to Palestinian Performing Arts Network in Gaza &amp; Lajee Centre in Bethlehem.
#Mayo #Spéirgorm</data>
